{
  "_comment": "Guide 评测题表。每题是一句用户原话、一个期望打开的指南篇目、以及最终回答里必须出现的词。规则与门槛在 cmd/skillmaster/guide_eval_test.go；改这里的题等于换一把尺。prompt 里不许出现期望篇目的文件名或 must 里的词。",
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "account-credentials-switch",
      "group": "account",
      "prompt": "我在两台电脑上都登录过，现在想把这台换成另一个账号；之前还设过环境变量里的一把密钥。",
      "page": "account/credentials.md",
      "must": [
        "SKILLMASTER_API_KEY",
        "skmr login"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "account-devices-revoke",
      "group": "account",
      "prompt": "有台笔记本丢了，我想让那台机器上的命令行立刻失效，再看看还有哪些密钥在用。",
      "page": "account/devices.md",
      "must": [
        "/account/sessions",
        "/account/keys"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "account-delete",
      "group": "account",
      "prompt": "我想彻底注销这个账号，在哪里做？注销后会怎样？",
      "page": "account/delete.md",
      "must": [
        "/account",
        "30 天"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "account-register",
      "group": "account",
      "prompt": "我还没有账号，想注册一个；第一段地址以后还能不能改？",
      "page": "account/register.md",
      "must": [
        "/register",
        "用户名"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "account-sign-in",
      "group": "account",
      "prompt": "登录有哪几种方式？我在一台没有浏览器的服务器上，怎么让它有凭据？",
      "page": "account/sign-in.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr login",
        "SKILLMASTER_API_KEY"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "author-create",
      "group": "author",
      "prompt": "我要从零新建一个 skill，名字和描述怎么定？",
      "page": "author/create.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr skill create",
        "description"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "author-describe",
      "group": "author",
      "prompt": "我的 skill 想被更多人搜到，标签和分类该怎么写？",
      "page": "author/describe.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr skill tag add",
        "skmr skills categories"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "author-draft-create",
      "group": "author",
      "prompt": "要把线上的 skill 改一改，但不想动线上；另开一份草稿怎么开？",
      "page": "author/draft-create.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr draft create",
        "线上版本"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "author-draft-meta",
      "group": "author",
      "prompt": "草稿要上线了，但版本列表里的名字还是「改一下」，说明也没写。",
      "page": "author/draft-meta.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr version rename",
        "skmr version note"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "author-edit",
      "group": "author",
      "prompt": "我已经有一份没上线的草稿，想改其中一个文件里的一句话。",
      "page": "author/edit.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr skill edit",
        "skmr version list"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "author-files",
      "group": "author",
      "prompt": "我想把草稿里的一个目录改名，再取一份到本地看看。",
      "page": "author/files.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr skill mv",
        "skmr skill get"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "author-media",
      "group": "author",
      "prompt": "我要把一份 PDF 和几张截图放进 skill 里。",
      "page": "author/media.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr skill write",
        "--from"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "author-upload",
      "group": "author",
      "prompt": "我本地有一整个目录，第一次传到平台，怎么传？",
      "page": "author/upload.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr skill submit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "concepts-library",
      "group": "concepts",
      "prompt": "「我的库」里到底有什么？把一个公开 skill 收进来或移出去分别怎么做？",
      "page": "concepts/library.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr skill join",
        "skmr skill leave"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "concepts-namespace",
      "group": "concepts",
      "prompt": "地址第一段是什么意思？我新建 skill 能不能选别人的那一段？",
      "page": "concepts/namespace.md",
      "must": [
        "命名空间",
        "账号名"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "concepts-versions",
      "group": "concepts",
      "prompt": "我改了文件，别人却说看不到，为什么？",
      "page": "concepts/versions-and-drafts.md",
      "must": [],
      "any": [
        "线上版本",
        "线上版",
        "冻结",
        "publish"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "concepts-visibility",
      "group": "concepts",
      "prompt": "公开·调用和公开·浏览有什么区别？公开之后还能收回吗？",
      "page": "concepts/visibility.md",
      "must": [
        "复制",
        "下载"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "concepts-what-is-a-skill",
      "group": "concepts",
      "prompt": "一个 skill 到底是一个文件还是一个目录？地址怎么组成？",
      "page": "concepts/what-is-a-skill.md",
      "must": [
        "SKILL.md",
        "命名空间"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "limits-quotas",
      "group": "limits",
      "prompt": "一个 skill 最多能放多少文件、单个文件多大？",
      "page": "limits/quotas.md",
      "must": [
        "512",
        "100 MiB"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ship-change-visibility",
      "group": "ship",
      "prompt": "我想把一个 skill 从私有改成公开，命令是什么？",
      "page": "ship/change-visibility.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr skill visibility"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ship-delete",
      "group": "ship",
      "prompt": "有个 skill 不想再让人用了，但以后可能还要用；应该下线还是删除？",
      "page": "ship/delete.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr skill offline",
        "恢复"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ship-notifications",
      "group": "ship",
      "prompt": "别人共享给我一个 skill，我该在哪里接受？",
      "page": "ship/notifications.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr notifications accept"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ship-release",
      "group": "ship",
      "prompt": "草稿写好了，怎么上线？上线后发现有问题怎么退回去？",
      "page": "ship/release.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr version publish",
        "skmr version rollback"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ship-share",
      "group": "ship",
      "prompt": "我想让同事能上线我的 skill，但不想让他改可见性；该给哪一档、怎么给？",
      "page": "ship/share.md",
      "must": [
        "--role maintain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "start-agent",
      "group": "start",
      "prompt": "怎么让 Claude Code 每次都记得先查 SkillMaster 的库？",
      "page": "start/agent.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr prompt print",
        "CLAUDE.md"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "start-first-skill",
      "group": "start",
      "prompt": "我第一次用，想从零建一个 skill 并上线，按什么顺序做？",
      "page": "start/first-skill.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr skill create",
        "skmr version publish"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "start-install",
      "group": "start",
      "prompt": "我在 macOS 上还没装命令行工具，装完怎么确认？",
      "page": "start/install.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr --version"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tips-for-authors",
      "group": "tips",
      "prompt": "我的 skill 写得很长，agent 总是不按它做；内容该怎么组织？",
      "page": "tips/for-authors.md",
      "must": [
        "SKILL.md",
        "入口"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trouble-env",
      "group": "trouble",
      "prompt": "命令报连不上服务端，还说被沙箱拦了，怎么排查？",
      "page": "trouble/env.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr doctor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trouble-feedback",
      "group": "trouble",
      "prompt": "我按文档做了还是失败，想把现场提交给平台。",
      "page": "trouble/feedback.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr feedback send"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trouble-invoke",
      "group": "trouble",
      "prompt": "加载一个 skill 时报没有权限，或者读到的内容是旧的。",
      "page": "trouble/invoke.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr skill versions",
        "版本码"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trouble-release",
      "group": "trouble",
      "prompt": "点上线后页面上没有能点的按钮，为什么？",
      "page": "trouble/release.md",
      "must": [
        "维护"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trouble-sign-in",
      "group": "trouble",
      "prompt": "登录报错：浏览器里没有同意；再试又说登录太频繁。",
      "page": "trouble/sign-in.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr login"
      ],
      "any": [
        "限流",
        "频率限制"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trouble-upload",
      "group": "trouble",
      "prompt": "上传时报「这一版和已有版本一模一样」和「缺名称」，分别怎么办？",
      "page": "trouble/upload.md",
      "must": [
        "--name",
        "草稿"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "use-copy",
      "group": "use",
      "prompt": "我想把别人的一个公开 skill 拿来改一改，发成自己的版本。",
      "page": "use/copy.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr skill copy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "use-inspect",
      "group": "use",
      "prompt": "用之前我想知道一个 skill 的许可证、它要什么环境、有哪些版本。",
      "page": "use/inspect.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr skill show",
        "skmr skill license"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "use-read-files",
      "group": "use",
      "prompt": "我只想看这个 skill 里的某一个文件，不想加载整份正文。",
      "page": "use/read-files.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr skill read"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "use-run",
      "group": "use",
      "prompt": "这个 skill 让我运行它 scripts 目录里的一个 Python 脚本。",
      "page": "use/run.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr run",
        "python3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "use-search",
      "group": "use",
      "prompt": "我想按意思找一个能处理 PDF 的 skill，还要列出我库里所有 skill。",
      "page": "use/search.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr skills search",
        "skmr skills list"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "use-secrets",
      "group": "use",
      "prompt": "脚本要用的 API key 不能写在代码里，怎么让它在我运行 skill 时自动带上？",
      "page": "use/secrets.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr secret set",
        "注入"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "use-usage",
      "group": "use",
      "prompt": "我想知道我发出去的 skill 最近有没有人用、被搜到后有没有人点。",
      "page": "use/usage.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr usage"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "use-invoke",
      "group": "use",
      "prompt": "我有个 skill 地址，想加载它的正文并记住这一版，照它做。",
      "page": "use/read-files.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr skill invoke"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trouble-feedback-attach",
      "group": "trouble",
      "prompt": "消息里已经有一张报错截图的路径，反馈前怎么先取到可提交的稳定路径？",
      "page": "trouble/feedback.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr feedback attach"
      ],
      "any": [
        "--copy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "use-search-label",
      "group": "use",
      "prompt": "想找需要 Python 的公开 skill，怎么按运行环境筛？",
      "page": "use/search.md",
      "must": [
        "skmr skills search",
        "--scope public"
      ],
      "any": [
        "--label"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
